+/**
+ * A property path: 1-3 dotted segments 35% of the time, 1-3 segments or bracketed parts joined by
+ * a dot or nothing 20, an array of up to 3 segments (a non-string one 30% of the time) 20, a
+ * special string 10, a non-string path 7, a deep path 8. Without `proto` no `__proto__` segment
